#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:324
msgid "脂肪 −1.5 kg 同時去脂體重 +1 kg"
msgstr "Fat -1.5 kg and lean mass +1 kg"

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:357
#, python-format
msgid ""
"先減脂：體脂 %(pct).1f%% 高於這個性別在田徑上的參考帶（%(low).0f–"
"%(high).0f%%）。掉下來的是純負重，力量不變、比值就自己上去。"
msgstr ""
"Cut first: body fat %(pct).1f%% is above the reference band for this sex in "
"track and field (%(low).0f-%(high).0f%%). What comes off is pure dead "
"weight, so strength stays and the ratio rises by itself."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:361
#, python-format
msgid ""
"先把飯吃夠：體脂 %(pct).1f%% 已經低於參考帶下緣（%(low).0f%%）。再減下去掉的"
"是肌肉與骨質，力量會跟著掉。"
msgstr ""
"Eat enough first: body fat %(pct).1f%% is already below the bottom of the "
"reference band (%(low).0f%%). Cutting further takes muscle and bone with it, "
"and strength follows them down."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:365
#, python-format
msgid ""
"小幅修一點：體脂 %(pct).1f%% 在參考帶內偏高的一半，慢慢修到 %(mid).1f%% 就"
"好，別在高強度期做大赤字。"
msgstr ""
"Trim a little: body fat %(pct).1f%% sits in the upper half of the reference "
"band. Ease down to %(mid).1f%% and do not run a large deficit during a high-"
"intensity block."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:369
#, python-format
msgid ""
"體脂 %(pct).1f%% 已經在參考帶的好位置，接下來靠加去脂體重把絕對力量抬上去，脂"
"肪維持不動。"
msgstr ""
"Body fat %(pct).1f%% is already in a good spot in the band. From here, raise "
"absolute strength by adding lean mass and keep fat where it is."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:382
#, python-format
msgid "每週約 +%(v0)s kg 去脂體重（再快就是加脂肪）"
msgstr "About +%(v0)s kg of lean mass per week (any faster is fat)"

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:393
#, python-format
msgid "每週約 %(v0)s kg（體重的 %(v1)s%%），緩降才守得住肌肉"
msgstr ""
"About %(v0)s kg per week (%(v1)s%% of body weight); only a slow drop holds "
"the muscle"

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:396
#, python-format
msgid "每週約 +%(v0)s kg，慢慢加回來"
msgstr "About +%(v0)s kg per week, put it back on slowly"

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:406
msgid "完成後"
msgstr "After"

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:451
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s 的絕對重量進步了 %(abs).1f%%，但體重同時多了 %(w)s kg，每公斤體重舉"
"得起的反而沒有變好——這一段長的比較像體重不是力量，下面的體脂數字要一起看。"
msgstr ""
"%(name)s went up %(abs).1f%% in absolute load, but body weight went up %(w)s "
"kg over the same stretch and what is lifted per kilogram did not improve. "
"This looks more like added weight than added strength; read it together with "
"the body-fat numbers below."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:458
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(name)s 的絕對重量幾乎沒動，但體重少了 %(w)s kg，相對力量進步 %(r).1f%%——這"
"正是減脂該有的樣子：力量守住、負重變輕。"
msgstr ""
"%(name)s barely moved in absolute load, but body weight is down %(w)s kg and "
"relative strength is up %(r).1f%%. This is what a cut should look like: "
"strength held, load to carry lighter."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:464
#, python-format
msgid ""
"體重多了 %(w)s kg，%(name)s 的相對力量卻掉了 %(r).1f%%——增上來的重量沒有換成"
"力量，先確認蛋白與重訓量，再決定要不要收一點熱量。"
msgstr ""
"Body weight is up %(w)s kg but relative strength on %(name)s dropped "
"%(r).1f%%. The added weight did not turn into strength, so check protein and "
"strength volume before pulling calories back."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:532
#, python-format
msgid ""
"這個體重低於現在的去脂體重（%(v0)s kg），代表連肌肉都要掉——先把目標放在體脂"
"率，不要只追體重數字。"
msgstr ""
"This weight is below your current lean mass (%(v0)s kg), which means muscle "
"would have to go too. Aim at the body-fat percentage instead of chasing the "
"number on the scale."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:542 .\templates\web\nutrition.html:296
msgid "自訂目標"
msgstr "Custom target"

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:586
msgid ""
"同時要掉脂肪又要加去脂體重（體態重組）是走得到的，但比單做一邊慢：熱量抓在維"
"持量附近、蛋白拉到 2.4 g/kg 去脂體重、重訓強度一點都不能降。"
msgstr ""
"Losing fat and adding lean mass at the same time (recomposition) is doable, "
"but slower than doing one at a time: keep calories near maintenance, take "
"protein to 2.4 g/kg of lean mass, and do not drop strength-training "
"intensity at all."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:591
#, python-format
msgid ""
"照這個目標算，每週要變動 %(v0)s kg，超過體重的 %(v1)s%%——把週數拉長一點，急降"
"連肌肉一起掉，比值反而變差。"
msgstr ""
"On this target the weekly change is %(v0)s kg, more than %(v1)s%% of body "
"weight. Stretch the timeline: a fast drop takes muscle with it and the ratio "
"ends up worse."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:597
#, python-format
msgid ""
"目標體脂 %(v0)s%% 低於這個性別的參考帶下緣（%(v1)s%%）。再低下去掉的是肌肉、"
"骨質與荷爾蒙，力量會跟著掉。"
msgstr ""
"A target of %(v0)s%% body fat is below the bottom of the reference band for "
"this sex (%(v1)s%%). Going lower takes muscle, bone and hormones with it, "
"and strength follows them down."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:603
#, python-format
msgid ""
"這個目標會少掉 %(v0)s kg 去脂體重，絕對力量會跟著下來——如果不是刻意要降量級，"
"把去脂體重守住再談體重。"
msgstr ""
"This target gives up %(v0)s kg of lean mass, and absolute strength goes with "
"it. Unless you are deliberately moving down a weight class, hold lean mass "
"first and talk about body weight after."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:617
#, python-format
msgid ""
"自訂目標：%(w)s kg / 體脂 %(f)s%%（去脂體重 %(l)s kg）。%(name)s 每公斤體重舉"
"得起的會從 %(now)s 變成 %(then)s。"
msgstr ""
"Custom target: %(w)s kg / %(f)s%% body fat (lean mass %(l)s kg). What "
"%(name)s lifts per kilogram of body weight goes from %(now)s to %(then)s."

#: .\analytics\body_strength.py:638
#, python-format
msgid "每週約 %(v0)s kg"
msgstr "About %(v0)s kg per week"

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:35
msgid "分訓練時期"
msgstr "By training period"

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:36 .\analytics\services.py:1061
#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:257
msgid "分年份"
msgstr "By year"

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:84 .\analytics\record_log.py:724
#: .\analytics\services.py:1208
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s 年"
msgstr "%(v0)s"

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:91
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s 年 W%(v1)s-%(v2)s"
msgstr "%(v0)s W%(v1)s-%(v2)s"

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:224
msgid ""
"這段時間的課還沒排進任何一個訓練時期。到年度計劃把分期建起來，這裡才分得出時"
"期來比。"
msgstr ""
"None of the sessions in this range sit inside a training period yet. Build "
"the phases in the annual plan and this page can compare period against "
"period."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:227
msgid "這段時間還沒有已完成的課，也沒有重量訓練紀錄。"
msgstr "No completed sessions and no weight-training records in this range."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:300
msgid ""
"這段時間沒有體測紀錄，所以只看得到絕對重量，算不出「每公斤體重舉得起多少」。"
msgstr ""
"No body-composition measurement in this range, so only the absolute weights "
"show; strength per kg of body weight cannot be worked out."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:304
msgid "這段時間的重量訓練還沒登過「幾公斤 × 幾次」，先去課表明細登幾組。"
msgstr ""
"No weight training in this range has been logged as \"kg x reps\" yet. Log a "
"few sets on the session detail first."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:316
#, python-format
msgid "目前只有「%(v0)s」這一組有資料，再多練一段時間才比得出差別。"
msgstr ""
"Only \"%(v0)s\" has data so far. Train through another block before there is "
"anything to compare."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:337
#, python-format
msgid ""
"每公斤體重舉得起的重量從 %(v0)s 的 %(v1)s 變成 %(v2)s 的 %(v3)s（%(v4)s%%）。"
msgstr ""
"Strength per kg of body weight went from %(v1)s in %(v0)s to %(v3)s in "
"%(v2)s (%(v4)s%%)."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:347
#, python-format
msgid "去脂體重同時多了 %(v0)s kg，是練出來的，不是輕出來的。"
msgstr ""
"Lean body mass rose %(v0)s kg over the same span: this was built, not cut."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:351
#, python-format
msgid "體脂率同時降了 %(v0)s 個百分點，比值變好有一部分來自體重變輕。"
msgstr ""
"Body fat fell %(v0)s percentage points over the same span, so part of the "
"better ratio comes from simply weighing less."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:355
msgid "要看是重量掉了，還是體重上去了——下面兩欄對著看。"
msgstr ""
"Is it the weights that dropped, or the body weight that went up? Read the "
"two columns below together."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:366
#, python-format
msgid "訓練時數 %(v0)s 小時 → %(v1)s 小時（%(v2)s%%），課次 %(v3)s → %(v4)s。"
msgstr ""
"Training hours %(v0)s h → %(v1)s h (%(v2)s%%), sessions %(v3)s → %(v4)s."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:375
msgid "時間加了但力量沒跟上，先檢查強度是不是不夠，或者恢復吃掉了效果。"
msgstr ""
"More hours, but strength did not follow. Check whether the intensity is too "
"low, or recovery is eating the gains."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:377
msgid "時間反而少了、力量還升，這一段的安排效率不錯，值得沿用。"
msgstr ""
"Fewer hours and strength still went up: this block was efficiently put "
"together and worth repeating."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:383
#, python-format
msgid ""
"體脂率 %(v0)s%% → %(v1)s%%，肌肉率 %(v2)s → %(v3)s，平均體重 %(v4)s → %(v5)s "
"kg。"
msgstr ""
"Body fat %(v0)s%% → %(v1)s%%, muscle %(v2)s → %(v3)s, average weight %(v4)s "
"→ %(v5)s kg."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:401
#, python-format
msgid "進步最多的動作是「%(v0)s」（%(v1)s%%）。"
msgstr "The biggest gain is \"%(v0)s\" (%(v1)s%%)."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:406
#, python-format
msgid "「%(v0)s」退了 %(v1)s%%，下一段可以特別排一下。"
msgstr "\"%(v0)s\" fell %(v1)s%%. Give it dedicated work in the next block."

#: .\analytics\dimensions.py:414
#, python-format
msgid "每小時的總噸位 %(v0)s：%(v1)s kg → %(v2)s：%(v3)s kg。"
msgstr "Tonnage per hour, %(v0)s: %(v1)s kg → %(v2)s: %(v3)s kg."

