"treatment / return to training), otherwise the trend cannot tell state apart "
"from ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:711
msgid "同期的傷患紀錄"
msgstr "Injuries logged over the same period"

#: .\analytics\services.py:713
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s%(v1)s（%(v2)s 起，%(v3)s）"
msgstr "%(v0)s%(v1)s (from %(v2)s, %(v3)s)"

#: .\analytics\services.py:716
msgid "。帶著這個傷練出來的數字，先當成受限表現，不要當成能力下降。"
msgstr ""
". Numbers produced while carrying this injury are a limited performance, not "
"a drop in ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:727 .\analytics\services.py:736
msgid "同期的訓練負荷"
msgstr "Training load over the same period"

#: .\analytics\services.py:737
msgid "課表完成紀錄還不夠，算不出 ACWR。先把每堂課的時長與 RPE 補齊。"
msgstr ""
"There are not enough completed sessions to work out ACWR. Fill in the "
"duration and RPE of each session first."

#: .\analytics\services.py:752
#, python-format
msgid "平均睡眠 %(v0)s 小時"
msgstr "Average sleep %(v0)s hours"

#: .\analytics\services.py:754
#, python-format
msgid "平均痠痛 %(v0)s/10"
msgstr "Average soreness %(v0)s/10"

#: .\analytics\services.py:758 .\analytics\services.py:769
msgid "同期的睡眠與恢復"
msgstr "Sleep and recovery over the same period"

#: .\analytics\services.py:760
msgid "。睡眠不足 7 小時的期間，速度與爆發力先掉，不代表能力退步。"
msgstr ""
". In stretches with under 7 hours of sleep, speed and power go first — that "
"is not a loss of ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:761
msgid "。恢復面看起來沒有明顯拖累。"
msgstr ". Recovery does not look like it is holding anything back."

#: .\analytics\services.py:770
msgid ""
"這段期間沒有恢復紀錄（睡眠、痠痛、壓力）。到營養／恢復頁補上，才判斷得出是疲"
"勞還是能力。"
msgstr ""
"There are no recovery records (sleep, soreness, stress) for this period. "
"Fill them in on the Nutrition & Recovery page so fatigue can be told apart "
"from ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:780
msgid "課表完成情況"
msgstr "How the sessions were completed"

#: .\analytics\services.py:781
#, python-format
msgid ""
"有 %(v0)s 組沒有成功完成（完成率 %(v1)s%%）。先確認是開太重／開太快，還是當天"
"狀態就不行。"
msgstr ""
"%(v0)s sets were not completed (%(v1)s%% completion). Check whether it was "
"set too heavy or too fast, or whether the athlete was simply off that day."

#: .\analytics\services.py:792
msgid "強度要求不一致"
msgstr "Required intensity is inconsistent"

#: .\analytics\services.py:793
msgid "這些紀錄混了 "
msgstr "These records mix "

#: .\analytics\services.py:794
msgid " 幾種強度要求。用上面的「分強度」比較，同一檔強度對同一檔強度看才準。"
msgstr ""
" different required intensities. Use \"By intensity\" above so like is "
"compared with like."

#: .\analytics\services.py:806
msgid "休息時間變了"
msgstr "Rest time changed"

#: .\analytics\services.py:807
#, python-format
msgid ""
"前段平均休息 %(v0)s 分、後段 %(v1)s 分。休息縮短本來就會讓數字變差，這是課表"
"設計不是能力變化。"
msgstr ""
"Rest averaged %(v0)s min early on and %(v1)s min later. Shorter rest makes "
"the numbers worse by design — that is programming, not ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:831
msgid "未分期"
msgstr "Unphased"

#: .\analytics\services.py:853
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s 第%(v1)s組"
msgstr "%(v0)s set %(v1)s"

#: .\analytics\services.py:904
msgid "尚無完成數值。到訓練日曆完成一堂 program 後，回來這裡把數據登進去。"
msgstr ""
"No results yet. Complete a session in the training calendar, then come back "
"and enter the data here."

#: .\analytics\services.py:915
msgid "只有 1 筆紀錄，再累積至少 1 筆才算得出趨勢。"
msgstr ""
"Only 1 record — at least 1 more is needed before a trend means anything."

#: .\analytics\services.py:942
msgid "這段紀錄有 "
msgstr "This stretch of records includes "

#: .\analytics\services.py:943
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s（%(v1)s 天）"
msgstr "%(v0)s (%(v1)s days)"

#: .\analytics\services.py:944
msgid "——這些日子本來就跑不出平常的水準，先把它們排除或分開看，再談進退步。"
msgstr ""
" — on those days the usual level was never on the cards, so set them aside "
"or read them separately before calling it progress or decline."

#: .\analytics\services.py:948
msgid "這段紀錄橫跨 "
msgstr "These records span "

#: .\analytics\services.py:950
msgid " 幾種狀態，各期的訓練目的不同，用上面的「分狀態」比較才對得起來。"
msgstr ""
" different states, each trained for a different purpose; use \"By status\" "
"above to line them up properly."

#: .\analytics\services.py:954
msgid ""
"這些紀錄都沒有註記當天的狀態。先在紀錄明細把狀態補上（季後休息期／訓練準備期"
"／比賽調整期／傷害治療期／恢復回歸期），分析才分得清是狀態造成的還是能力變"
"化。"
msgstr ""
"None of these records say what state the athlete was in. Fill the status in "
"first in the record detail (off-season / preparation / taper / injury "
"treatment / return to training) so the analysis can tell state apart from "
"ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:959
#, python-format
msgid "每月約 %(v0)s %(v1)s"
msgstr "about %(v0)s %(v1)s per month"

#: .\analytics\services.py:961
msgid "但算不出每月變化（紀錄集中在同一天）"
msgstr ""
"but the monthly rate of change cannot be worked out (the records fall on one "
"day)"

#: .\analytics\services.py:964
#, python-format
msgid "趨勢向好，%(v0)s。"
msgstr "The trend is up, %(v0)s."

#: .\analytics\services.py:966
msgid ""
"在上面的狀態與同期條件都確認過之後，這個進步才算數；確認無誤就維持目前的課表"
"方向，別急著加量。"
msgstr ""
"This counts as progress once the states and conditions above check out; if "
"they do, keep the programme heading the same way and do not rush to add "
"volume."

#: .\analytics\services.py:969
#, python-format
msgid "數字上是退步，%(v0)s。"
msgstr "The numbers are down, %(v0)s."

#: .\analytics\services.py:972
msgid "但同期有"
msgstr "But over the same period there was "

#: .\analytics\services.py:973
msgid ""
"，這種狀態下數字本來就會掉——先當成狀態造成的受限表現，等回到正常訓練狀態再重"
"新取一段來比。"
msgstr ""
", and in that state the numbers drop anyway — treat it as a limited "
"performance and take a fresh stretch to compare once training is back to "
"normal."

#: .\analytics\services.py:977
msgid ""
"先把上面列的因素逐項對過（狀態註記、傷患、ACWR、睡眠、完成率、強度與休息是否"
"一致）——多數情況是累積疲勞或條件改變，全部排除之後才判定是能力下降。"
msgstr ""
"Work through the factors listed above one by one (status notes, injuries, "
"ACWR, sleep, completion rate, and whether intensity and rest were "
"consistent). Most of the time it is accumulated fatigue or changed "
"conditions; only once all of them are ruled out is it a drop in ability."

#: .\analytics\services.py:980
msgid "數值持平。"
msgstr "The numbers are flat."

#: .\analytics\services.py:981
msgid ""
"先確認上面的狀態與條件沒有變；沒有的話，可考慮調整刺激（強度或動作選擇）。"
msgstr ""
"Check first that the states and conditions above have not changed; if they "
"have not, consider changing the stimulus (intensity or exercise choice)."

#: .\analytics\services.py:985
msgid " 另外波動偏大，記錄時記得註明狀態與情境（風速、組次、疲勞度）。"
msgstr ""
" The spread is also wide — note the state and the context (wind, set number, "
"fatigue) when recording."

#: .\analytics\services.py:989
#, python-format
msgid ""
" 有 %(v0)s 組沒有成功完成（完成率 %(v1)s%%），重量或組數可能開太高，下一輪先"
"降 5–10%% 再往上疊。"
msgstr ""
" %(v0)s sets were not completed (%(v1)s%% completion); the weight or the "
"number of sets may be set too high, so drop 5–10%% next round before "
"building back up."

