#: .\core\glossary.py:17
msgid "跑動力學"
msgstr "Sprint mechanics"

#: .\core\glossary.py:18
msgid ""
"描述「跑起來的樣子」的詞。這些是教練在跑道邊觀察與錄影回放時使用的語言。"
msgstr ""
"Words that describe what running looks like. This is the language coaches "
"use at the trackside and when reviewing video."

#: .\core\glossary.py:22
msgid "起跑架推離"
msgstr "Block clearance"

#: .\core\glossary.py:23
msgid ""
"從槍響到雙腳離開起跑器的整個動作。看的是推蹬方向與離架時的軀幹角度，而不是誰"
"先站起來。"
msgstr ""
"The whole movement from the gun to both feet leaving the blocks. What "
"matters is the direction of the drive and the trunk angle on exit, not who "
"stands up first."

#: .\core\glossary.py:27
msgid "加速推進期"
msgstr "Drive phase"

#: .\core\glossary.py:28
msgid ""
"起跑後身體仍明顯前傾、每一步都在增加速度的階段，一般約前 20–30 公尺。此時的力"
"量主要用於水平推進。"
msgstr ""
"The phase after the start where the body is still clearly leaning and every "
"step adds speed, usually the first 20–30 metres. The force here goes into "
"horizontal drive."

#: .\core\glossary.py:32
msgid "轉換期"
msgstr "Transition phase"

#: .\core\glossary.py:33
msgid ""
"由前傾的推進姿勢過渡到直立跑姿的過程。過早站直會提早結束加速，拖太久則進不了"
"最高速。"
msgstr ""
"The move from the forward-leaning drive position into an upright sprint "
"posture. Standing up too early ends acceleration early; dragging it out "
"means never reaching top speed."

#: .\core\glossary.py:37 .\templates\site\landing.html:162
msgid "最大速度"
msgstr "Max Velocity"

#: .\core\glossary.py:38
msgid ""
"一趟跑動中所能達到的最高瞬時速度，通常出現在 30–60 公尺之間。它是短跑成績的天"
"花板。"
msgstr ""
"The highest instantaneous speed reached in a run, usually between 30 and 60 "
"metres. It is the ceiling on a sprint time."

#: .\core\glossary.py:42
msgid "速度耐力"
msgstr "Speed endurance"

#: .\core\glossary.py:43
msgid "在接近最高速的狀態下維持速度、抵抗減速的能力。決定 60 公尺之後的表現。"
msgstr ""
"The ability to hold speed close to maximum and resist slowing down. It "
"decides what happens after 60 metres."

#: .\core\glossary.py:47
msgid "減速"
msgstr "Deceleration"

#: .\core\glossary.py:48
msgid ""
"最高速之後不可避免的掉速。名次往往取決於誰掉得比較少，而不是誰的最高速比較"
"快。"
msgstr ""
"The unavoidable loss of speed after top velocity. Places are usually decided "
"by who slows least, not by who was fastest."

#: .\core\glossary.py:52
msgid "觸地時間"
msgstr "Ground contact time"

#: .\core\glossary.py:53
msgid ""
"腳掌接觸地面的時間，優秀短跑選手在最高速時約 0.08–0.10 秒。觸地時間變長是疲勞"
"最早出現的訊號之一。"
msgstr ""
"How long the foot stays on the ground; good sprinters are around 0.08–0.10 "
"sec at top speed. Longer ground contact is one of the earliest signs of "
"fatigue."

#: .\core\glossary.py:57
msgid "騰空時間"
msgstr "Flight time"

#: .\core\glossary.py:58
msgid "兩次觸地之間身體離地的時間。與觸地時間的比例決定跑動的節奏與效率。"
msgstr ""
"The time in the air between two ground contacts. Its ratio to ground contact "
"time sets the rhythm and the efficiency of the run."

#: .\core\glossary.py:62
msgid "步幅"
msgstr "Stride length"

#: .\core\glossary.py:63
msgid ""
"每一步前進的距離。刻意拉大步幅通常會讓腳掌落在重心前方而產生制動，反而變慢。"
msgstr ""
"The distance covered by each step. Deliberately reaching for a longer stride "
"usually lands the foot ahead of the centre of mass and brakes the run."

#: .\core\glossary.py:67 .\templates\web\video_detail.html:166
msgid "步頻"
msgstr "Stride frequency"

#: .\core\glossary.py:68
msgid ""
"每秒的步數。步頻與步幅相乘就是速度，兩者無法同時最大化，訓練是在找平衡點。"
msgstr ""
"Steps per second. Frequency times stride length is speed; the two cannot "
"both be maximised, so training looks for the balance."

#: .\core\glossary.py:72
msgid "前側力學"
msgstr "Front-side mechanics"

#: .\core\glossary.py:73
msgid "大腿在身體前方完成抬起與下放的動作模式，是高速跑動的特徵。"
msgstr ""
"The movement pattern where the thigh lifts and comes down in front of the "
"body — the signature of running at high speed."

#: .\core\glossary.py:77
msgid "後側力學"
msgstr "Back-side mechanics"

#: .\core\glossary.py:78
msgid ""
"腳留在身體後方過久、靠折疊小腿回收的模式。常見於加速期尚未結束就直立的跑者。"
msgstr ""
"Leaving the foot behind the body too long and recovering by folding the "
"lower leg up. Common in runners who stand up before acceleration is finished."

#: .\core\glossary.py:82
msgid "脛骨角度"
msgstr "Shin angle"

#: .\core\glossary.py:83
msgid "觸地瞬間小腿與地面的夾角。加速期需要明顯前傾的角度來產生水平推進力。"
msgstr ""
"The angle of the shin to the ground at touchdown. Acceleration needs a "
"clearly forward angle to produce horizontal drive."

#: .\core\glossary.py:87
msgid "制動力"
msgstr "Braking force"

#: .\core\glossary.py:88
msgid ""
"腳掌落在重心前方時產生的向後作用力。是「跑得很用力卻不快」最常見的原因。"
msgstr ""
"The backward force produced when the foot lands ahead of the centre of mass. "
"It is the most common reason for running hard but not fast."

#: .\core\glossary.py:92
msgid "三關節伸展"
msgstr "Triple extension"

#: .\core\glossary.py:93
msgid "髖、膝、踝在推蹬瞬間同時伸展。加速期與奧林匹克舉共用的發力模式。"
msgstr ""
"Hip, knee and ankle extending together at push-off. The same pattern is used "
"in acceleration and in the Olympic lifts."

#: .\core\glossary.py:97
msgid "足背屈"
msgstr "Dorsiflexion"

#: .\core\glossary.py:98
msgid "腳尖朝上勾起的踝關節位置。維持足背屈能讓小腿像彈簧一樣儲存與回彈能量。"
msgstr ""
"The ankle held with the toes pulled up. Keeping dorsiflexion lets the lower "
"leg store and return energy like a spring."

#: .\core\glossary.py:105
msgid "生理與發力"
msgstr "Physiology and force production"

#: .\core\glossary.py:106
msgid ""
"解釋「為什麼會快、為什麼會累」的詞。訓練安排的休息時間與課間隔都由這些概念決"
"定。"
msgstr ""
"Words that explain why an athlete is fast and why they tire. Rest periods "
"and the spacing of sessions all follow from these ideas."

#: .\core\glossary.py:110
msgid "磷酸原系統"
msgstr "Phosphagen system"

#: .\core\glossary.py:111
msgid ""
"6–10 秒內全力輸出的能量來源，不產生乳酸。100 公尺的主要供能系統，恢復需要數分"
"鐘而非數十秒。"
msgstr ""
"The energy source for all-out efforts of 6–10 seconds, producing no lactate. "
"It is the main system for the 100 m, and it recovers in minutes rather than "
"tens of seconds."

#: .\core\glossary.py:115
msgid "醣解系統"
msgstr "Glycolytic system"

#: .\core\glossary.py:116
msgid ""
"約 10–60 秒的高強度供能途徑，伴隨乳酸與氫離子堆積。200/400 公尺的主戰場。"
msgstr ""
"The high-intensity pathway for roughly 10–60 seconds, with lactate and "
"hydrogen ions building up. This is the battleground of the 200 m and the 400 "
"m."

#: .\core\glossary.py:120
msgid "耐乳酸能力"
msgstr "Lactate tolerance"

#: .\core\glossary.py:121
msgid ""
"在代謝物堆積、肌肉發燙的狀態下仍維持動作品質的能力。這類課恢復慢，通常一週不"
"超過一次。"
msgstr ""
"The ability to hold movement quality while metabolites build up and the "
"muscles burn. These sessions recover slowly, usually no more than once a "
"week."

#: .\core\glossary.py:125
msgid "神經肌肉疲勞"
msgstr "Neuromuscular fatigue"

#: .\core\glossary.py:126
msgid ""
"神經徵召能力下降造成的疲勞，肌肉不一定痠。表現是速度掉、觸地變長，但自覺還"
"「跑得動」。"
msgstr ""
"Fatigue caused by a drop in neural drive, with no muscle soreness needed. It "
"shows up as slower speed and longer ground contact while the athlete still "
"feels able to run."

#: .\core\glossary.py:130
msgid "發力率"
msgstr "Rate of force development"

#: .\core\glossary.py:131
msgid ""
"單位時間內能產生多少力量。短跑觸地只有 0.1 秒，能用出多少力比最大力量本身更重"
"要。"
msgstr ""
"How much force can be produced in the time available. Ground contact in a "
"sprint lasts about 0.1 sec, so how fast force arrives matters more than "
"maximum strength."

#: .\core\glossary.py:135
msgid "伸展—收縮循環"
msgstr "Stretch-shortening cycle"

#: .\core\glossary.py:136
msgid "肌腱先被拉長儲存彈性能，再迅速回彈釋放。跑步、跳躍的效率核心。"
msgstr ""
"The tendon is stretched to store elastic energy, then rebounds to release "
"it. It is the core of efficient running and jumping."

#: .\core\glossary.py:140
msgid "反應力量指數"
msgstr "Reactive strength index"

#: .\core\glossary.py:141
msgid "跳躍高度除以觸地時間，用來量化彈性能力。可作為疲勞監控的日常指標。"
msgstr ""
"Jump height divided by ground contact time, used to put a number on "
"elasticity. It works well as a day-to-day fatigue check."

#: .\core\glossary.py:145
msgid "彈性剛度"
msgstr "Elastic stiffness"

#: .\core\glossary.py:146
msgid "觸地瞬間下肢抵抗塌陷的能力。剛度不足時力量會被關節吸收而非傳回地面。"
msgstr ""
"The ability of the leg to resist collapsing at touchdown. Without stiffness, "
"force is absorbed by the joints instead of returned to the ground."

#: .\core\glossary.py:150
msgid "離心力量"
msgstr "Eccentric strength"

#: .\core\glossary.py:151
msgid ""
"肌肉被拉長時抵抗的力量。膕繩肌在擺動末期正是離心收縮，也是拉傷最常發生的瞬"
"間。"
msgstr ""
"The force a muscle produces while being lengthened. The hamstring works "
"eccentrically at the end of the swing — the moment strains happen."

#: .\core\glossary.py:155
msgid "功率體重比"
msgstr "Power-to-weight ratio"

#: .\core\glossary.py:156
msgid "相對於體重的輸出功率。短跑增重只有在功率同步增加時才有意義。"
msgstr ""
"Power output relative to body weight. Gaining weight only helps a sprinter "
"if power rises with it."

#: .\core\glossary.py:163
msgid "訓練手段"
msgstr "Training methods"

#: .\core\glossary.py:164
msgid ""
"跑道與重量室裡實際會用到的手段名稱。用同一套詞彙，教練與運動員才不會各說各"
"話。"
msgstr ""
"The names of what actually gets done on the track and in the weight room. "
"Sharing this vocabulary keeps coach and athlete talking about the same thing."

#: .\core\glossary.py:169
msgid "先以助跑段加速，再進入計時區跑最高速。訓練最大速度最直接的手段。"
msgstr ""
"Accelerate over a run-in, then run top speed through a timed zone. The most "
"direct way to train maximum velocity."

#: .\core\glossary.py:174
msgid ""
"拖／推雪橇或穿阻力帶的加速跑。阻力以掉速不超過約 10% 為原則，太重會改變跑姿。"
msgstr ""
"Acceleration runs towing or pushing a sled, or wearing a resistance band. "
"Keep the load light enough that speed drops no more than about 10%, since "
"heavier changes the running form."

#: .\core\glossary.py:178
msgid "助力跑（超速跑）"
msgstr "Assisted (overspeed) running"

#: .\core\glossary.py:179
msgid ""
"以彈力繩或下坡協助跑出超過自身最高速的速度，用來提升步頻上限。風險較高。"
msgstr ""
"Using a bungee or a downhill to run faster than the athlete's own top speed, "
"to raise the ceiling on step frequency. It carries more risk."

#: .\core\glossary.py:184
msgid ""
"約 60–75% 強度的中低強度反覆跑，用於恢復與有氧底子，不是拿來追成績的課。"
msgstr ""
"Repetition runs at roughly 60–75% intensity, for recovery and aerobic base. "
"It is not a session for chasing times."

#: .\core\glossary.py:188
msgid "廣泛／密集節奏跑"
msgstr "Extensive / intensive tempo"

#: .\core\glossary.py:189
msgid ""
"廣泛節奏強度低、量大，屬恢復性質；密集節奏強度接近 80–89%，已具訓練壓力。"
msgstr ""
"Extensive tempo is low intensity and high volume, essentially recovery; "
"intensive tempo runs near 80–89% and carries real training stress."

#: .\core\glossary.py:193
msgid "特殊耐力"
msgstr "Special endurance"

#: .\core\glossary.py:194
msgid "以比賽距離或稍長的距離、接近比賽強度進行的課，例如 300／250／200 遞減。"
msgstr ""
"Work at or slightly beyond race distance at close to race intensity, for "
"example a descending 300 / 250 / 200."

#: .\core\glossary.py:198
msgid "增強式訓練"
msgstr "Plyometrics"

#: .\core\glossary.py:199
msgid ""
"利用伸展—收縮循環的跳躍訓練。以落地次數而非時間計量，並排在疲勞之前進行。"
msgstr ""
"Jump training that uses the stretch-shortening cycle. Count it in foot "
"contacts rather than in minutes, and place it before fatigue sets in."

#: .\core\glossary.py:203
msgid "對比訓練"
msgstr "Contrast training"

#: .\core\glossary.py:204
msgid "重負荷動作後緊接爆發動作（如深蹲接跳箱），利用後激活增益提升輸出。"
msgstr ""
"A heavy lift followed straight away by an explosive movement (squat into box "
"jump), using post-activation potentiation to raise output."

#: .\core\glossary.py:208
msgid "後激活增益"
msgstr "Post-activation potentiation"

#: .\core\glossary.py:209
msgid "重負荷刺激後短時間內爆發表現提升的現象。賽前激活課的理論依據。"
msgstr ""
"The short-lived boost in explosive performance after a heavy stimulus. It is "
"the reasoning behind pre-competition priming sessions."

#: .\core\glossary.py:213
msgid "標誌欄跑"
msgstr "Wicket runs"

#: .\core\glossary.py:214
msgid "以等距矮欄架強制固定步幅與觸地位置，用來建立最高速的跑姿。"
msgstr ""
"Evenly spaced low hurdles that fix stride length and touchdown position, "
"used to build top-speed running form."

#: .\core\glossary.py:218
msgid "推牆練習"
msgstr "Wall drills"

#: .\core\glossary.py:219
msgid "手扶牆維持前傾角度做原地推蹬，用於建立加速期的姿勢與節奏。"
msgstr ""
"Pushing against a wall on the spot while holding the forward lean, to build "
"the posture and the rhythm of the acceleration phase."

#: .\core\glossary.py:223
msgid "A 字跳／B 字跳"
msgstr "A-skips / B-skips"

#: .\core\glossary.py:224
msgid "把跑步動作拆解的熱身練習：A 強調抬膝與觸地，B 再加上小腿前伸與扒地。"
msgstr ""
"Warm-up drills that break running down: A emphasises knee lift and "
"touchdown, B adds the lower-leg reach and the paw-back."

#: .\core\glossary.py:228
msgid "加速階梯"
msgstr "Acceleration ladder"

#: .\core\glossary.py:229
msgid "距離逐段遞增的加速跑（如 20／30／40 公尺），讓加速姿勢逐步過渡到直立。"
msgstr ""
"Acceleration runs over progressively longer distances (20 / 30 / 40 m), "
"letting the acceleration posture rise gradually to upright."

#: .\core\glossary.py:233
msgid "蹲踞式起跑"
msgstr "Crouch start"

#: .\core\glossary.py:234
msgid "使用起跑架的正式起跑。包含各就位、預備、槍響三個階段的節奏。"
msgstr ""
"A formal start out of the blocks, including the rhythm of on your marks, set "
"and the gun."

#: .\core\glossary.py:241
msgid "負荷與監控"
msgstr "Load and monitoring"

#: .\core\glossary.py:242
msgid ""
"ATM 系統實際計算與追蹤的指標。這些數字讓「今天要練多重」從感覺變成有依據的判"
"斷。"
msgstr ""
"The numbers ATM actually calculates and tracks. They turn \"how hard should "
"today be\" from a feeling into a decision with something behind it."

#: .\core\glossary.py:246
msgid "課後主觀強度"
msgstr "Session RPE"

#: .\core\glossary.py:247
msgid ""
"課後 30 分鐘給出的 1–10 分自覺強度，乘以實際訓練時長就是該堂課的訓練負荷。"
msgstr ""
"The 1–10 rating of perceived effort given 30 minutes after a session; "
"multiplied by the actual duration it gives that session's training load."

#: .\core\glossary.py:251 .\templates\web\_session_body.html:88
#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:30
msgid "訓練負荷"
msgstr "Training Load"

#: .\core\glossary.py:252
msgid ""
"sRPE × 時長所得的任意單位（AU）。單位本身沒有意義，有意義的是它跨週的變化。"
msgstr ""
"sRPE times duration, in arbitrary units (AU). The unit means nothing on its "
"own; what means something is how it changes from week to week."

#: .\core\glossary.py:256
msgid "急慢性負荷比"
msgstr "Acute:chronic workload ratio"

#: .\core\glossary.py:257
msgid ""
"近 7 天負荷相對於近 28 天平均週負荷的比值。約 0.80–1.30 為相對安全區間，過高"
"代表增量太快。"
msgstr ""
"The last 7 days of load against the average week of the last 28 days. "
"Roughly 0.80–1.30 is the relatively safe band; higher means volume went up "
"too fast."

#: .\core\glossary.py:262
msgid ""
"一週內每日負荷的平均值除以標準差。數值高代表每天都一樣重，缺乏高低起伏，與過"
"度訓練相關。"
msgstr ""
"The average daily load of a week divided by its standard deviation. A high "
"value means every day is the same weight, with no highs and lows, and is "
"linked to overtraining."

#: .\core\glossary.py:266
msgid "訓練壓力"
msgstr "Training stress"

#: .\core\glossary.py:267
msgid "週總負荷乘以單調度。同樣的總量，分佈越平均，身體承受的壓力越大。"
msgstr ""
"Weekly load times monotony. For the same total, the more evenly it is "
"spread, the more strain the body carries."

#: .\core\glossary.py:271 .\templates\web\coach_dashboard.html:35
#: .\templates\web\plan_detail.html:46
msgid "準備度"
msgstr "Readiness"

#: .\core\glossary.py:272
msgid ""
"由睡眠、痠痛、壓力與疼痛換算的每日狀態分數，用來決定當天要不要照原計劃練。"
msgstr ""
"A daily readiness score worked out from sleep, soreness, stress and pain, "
"used to decide whether to train as planned that day."

#: .\core\glossary.py:276
msgid "量／強度"
msgstr "Volume / intensity"

#: .\core\glossary.py:277
msgid ""
"量是做了多少（距離、組數），強度是做得多接近極限（% 最佳成績、% 1RM）。兩者不"
"應同時往上加。"
msgstr ""
"Volume is how much was done (distance, sets); intensity is how close to the "
"limit it was (% of best, % of 1RM). The two should not go up together."

#: .\core\glossary.py:281
msgid "密度"
msgstr "Density"

#: .\core\glossary.py:282
msgid ""
"同樣的工作量壓縮在多短的時間內完成。縮短休息就是提高密度，也提高了實際強度。"
msgstr ""
"How much the same work is compressed in time. Cutting rest raises density, "
"and with it the real intensity."

#: .\core\glossary.py:286
msgid "週期化"
msgstr "Periodisation"

#: .\core\glossary.py:287
msgid "把訓練依時間切成階段，讓能力在目標賽事時達到高峰的安排方式。"
msgstr ""
"Splitting training into blocks over time so that form peaks at the target "
"competition."

#: .\core\glossary.py:291
msgid "大／中／小週期"
msgstr "Macro / meso / microcycle"

#: .\core\glossary.py:292
msgid "分別對應整個賽季、數週的訓練階段，以及一週的課表結構。"
msgstr ""
"The season as a whole, a block of several weeks, and the structure of a "
"single week."

#: .\core\glossary.py:296
msgid "賽前減量"
msgstr "Taper"

#: .\core\glossary.py:297
msgid "賽前降低訓練量但維持強度，讓疲勞消退而能力保留。通常需要 7–14 天。"
msgstr ""
"Cutting volume but holding intensity before a competition, so fatigue clears "
"while fitness stays. It usually takes 7–14 days."

#: .\core\glossary.py:301
msgid "超量恢復"
msgstr "Supercompensation"

#: .\core\glossary.py:302
msgid ""
"適當負荷後身體恢復到高於原有水準的現象。恢復不足就練下一課，累積的是疲勞而不"
"是進步。"
msgstr ""
"The body rebuilding above its previous level after an appropriate load. "
"Training the next session before that has happened builds fatigue, not "
"progress."

#: .\core\glossary.py:306
msgid "負荷驟增"
msgstr "Load spike"

#: .\core\glossary.py:307
msgid "單週負荷相對於前期基線大幅上升。是可預測性最高的受傷前兆之一。"
msgstr ""
"A sharp rise in one week's load against the recent baseline. It is one of "
"the most predictable warnings before an injury."

#: .\core\glossary.py:311
msgid "個人最佳／本季最佳"
msgstr "Personal best / season best"

#: .\core\glossary.py:312
msgid "個人歷來與本季的最佳成績。是分析趨勢與設定目標時的基準線。"
msgstr ""
"The best marks of a career and of the current season. They are the baseline "
"for reading trends and setting targets."

#: .\core\glossary.py:319
msgid "傷患與可用度"
msgstr "Injury and availability"

#: .\core\glossary.py:320
msgid "傷患管理的共同語言。能不能站上跑道，比任何一堂課的內容都重要。"
msgstr ""
"The shared language of injury management. Being able to get on the track "
"matters more than anything in a single session."

#: .\core\glossary.py:324
msgid "膕繩肌拉傷"
msgstr "Hamstring strain"

#: .\core\glossary.py:325
msgid "短跑最常見的傷患，多發生於高速擺動末期。復發率高，回歸過早是主要原因。"
msgstr ""
"The most common sprint injury, usually at the end of the high-speed swing. "
"It recurs often, mostly because athletes return too early."

#: .\core\glossary.py:329 .\core\models.py:28
msgid "輕微不適"
msgstr "Mild discomfort"

#: .\core\glossary.py:330
msgid "尚未影響訓練、但持續存在的小痛。及早記錄能避免它變成真正的傷患。"
msgstr ""
"A small ache that does not yet affect training but will not go away. Logging "
"it early keeps it from becoming a real injury."

#: .\core\glossary.py:334
msgid "可用度"
msgstr "Availability"

#: .\core\glossary.py:335
msgid "運動員能夠正常參與訓練與比賽的時間比例。長期表現的最強預測指標。"
msgstr ""
"The proportion of time an athlete can train and compete normally. It is the "
"strongest predictor of long-term performance."

#: .\core\glossary.py:339 .\injury\models.py:49
msgid "回歸跑動"
msgstr "Return to Running"

#: .\core\glossary.py:340
msgid "傷後由復健過渡到跑道的階段，以漸進的速度與量重新暴露於跑動負荷。"
msgstr ""
"The stage from rehab back onto the track, re-exposing the athlete to running "
"load with speed and volume built up gradually."

#: .\core\glossary.py:344
msgid "回歸比賽"
msgstr "Return to competition"

#: .\core\glossary.py:345
msgid ""
"通過力量、活動度與速度的客觀檢核後恢復完整訓練與比賽。應以標準判定，而非以天"
"數判定。"
msgstr ""
"A return to full training and competition after passing objective strength, "
"mobility and speed checks. Decide it on criteria, not on the number of days."

#: .\core\glossary.py:349
msgid "疼痛監控"
msgstr "Pain monitoring"

#: .\core\glossary.py:350
msgid ""
"以 0–10 分記錄靜態與活動時的疼痛。ATM 在活動時疼痛達門檻時，當日高強度課會自"
"動降級。"
msgstr ""
"Recording pain at rest and during activity from 0 to 10. When pain during "
"activity hits the threshold, ATM automatically downgrades that day's high-"
"intensity session."

#: .\core\glossary.py:354 .\injury\models.py:386 .\injury\models.py:400
#: .\injury\models.py:401
msgid "替代動作"
msgstr "Alternative Exercise"

#: .\core\glossary.py:355
msgid ""
"依受傷部位把原本的動作換成不加重傷勢的版本，讓訓練得以繼續而非全面停止。"
msgstr ""
"Swapping the planned movement for a version that does not aggravate the "
"injury, so training continues instead of stopping altogether."

#: .\core\liveedit.py:38
#, python-format
msgid "最多 %(v0)s 個字。"
msgstr "At most %(v0)s characters."

#: .\core\liveedit.py:47 .\core\liveedit.py:64
