"Pain during activity today reached %(v0)s/10 (threshold %(v1)s), so high-"
"intensity sessions are blocked."

#: .\injury\services.py:42
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s 處於急性期，禁止高強度訓練。"
msgstr "%(v0)s is in the acute phase; high-intensity training is not allowed."

#: .\injury\services.py:113
#, python-format
msgid "[傷患調整] %(v0)s"
msgstr "[Injury adjustment] %(v0)s"

#: .\injury\services.py:117
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(v0)s\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ 系統自動調整：%(v1)s\n"
"建議改為：上肢循環、水中跑、活動度與核心穩定訓練。"
msgstr ""
"%(v0)s\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Automatic system adjustment: %(v1)s\n"
"Suggested instead: upper-body circuits, water running, mobility and core "
"stability work."

#: .\injury\services.py:142
#, python-format
msgid "傷患替代：原 %(v0)s"
msgstr "Injury substitute: originally %(v0)s"

#: .\injury\services.py:151
msgid "疼痛超過所有替代方案的容許值，建議暫停此動作。"
msgstr ""
"The pain is above what every substitute allows; it is better to drop this "
"exercise for now."

#: .\injury\services.py:177
msgid "無痛全速跑（疼痛 0/10，連續 3 次訓練）"
msgstr "Pain-free full-speed running (pain 0/10, three sessions in a row)"

#: .\injury\services.py:178
msgid "患側 / 健側等長力量差異 < 10%"
msgstr "Isometric strength difference between injured and healthy side < 10%"

#: .\injury\services.py:179
msgid "CMJ 恢復至個人基線的 90% 以上"
msgstr "CMJ back to 90% or more of personal baseline"

#: .\injury\services.py:180
msgid "完成專項技術動作無代償"
msgstr "Event-specific technical work completed with no compensation"

#: .\injury\services.py:181
msgid "連續 7 天靜態疼痛為 0"
msgstr "Pain at rest of 0 for 7 days running"

#: .\injury\services.py:182
msgid "醫療人員 / 物理治療師書面同意"
msgstr "Written clearance from medical staff / physiotherapist"

#: .\injury\services.py:202
msgid "全部條件達標方可回歸完整訓練；任一未達標請維持 RTP 階段。"
msgstr ""
"Every criterion must be met before returning to full training; if any one is "
"unmet, stay in the RTP phase."

#: .\injury\services.py:211
msgid "Protect 保護"
msgstr "Protect"

#: .\injury\services.py:211
msgid "立即停止運動、卸下負重或用拐杖護具限制患部活動，避免二次傷害。"
msgstr ""
"Stop activity immediately, take the weight off, or use crutches or a brace "
"to limit movement of the injured area and avoid a second injury."

#: .\injury\services.py:212
msgid "Elevate 抬高"
msgstr "Elevate"

#: .\injury\services.py:212
msgid "把受傷肢體抬到高於心臟，靠重力促進回流、減少腫脹。"
msgstr ""
"Raise the injured limb above heart level so gravity helps the return flow "
"and reduces swelling."

#: .\injury\services.py:213
msgid "Avoid 避免消炎"
msgstr "Avoid anti-inflammatories"

#: .\injury\services.py:213
msgid ""
"避免長時間冰敷與過度使用消炎藥（NSAIDs）——早期發炎是組織修復的必要過程。"
msgstr ""
"Avoid long icing sessions and heavy use of NSAIDs — early inflammation is a "
"necessary part of tissue repair."

#: .\injury\services.py:214
msgid "Compress 壓迫"
msgstr "Compress"

#: .\injury\services.py:214
msgid "用彈性繃帶或壓力襪包裹患部，限制關節腔與組織間的腫脹。"
msgstr ""
"Wrap the area with an elastic bandage or compression sleeve to limit "
"swelling in the joint and the tissue."

#: .\injury\services.py:215
msgid "Educate 衛教"
msgstr "Educate"

#: .\injury\services.py:215
msgid "聽身體的聲音、找專業人員評估，別盲目推拿或提早復出。"
msgstr ""
"Listen to the body, get a professional assessment, and do not push into "
"blind manual therapy or an early comeback."

#: .\injury\services.py:220
msgid "Load 適度負重"
msgstr "Load"

#: .\injury\services.py:220
msgid "在不引起明顯疼痛的前提下及早負重，刺激纖維重新正確排列。"
msgstr ""
"Load the area early, as long as it causes no clear pain, to stimulate the "
"fibres to realign correctly."

#: .\injury\services.py:221
msgid "Optimism 保持樂觀"
msgstr "Optimism"

#: .\injury\services.py:221
msgid "心理因素影響康復速度，建立信心能顯著提升復健成效。"
msgstr ""
"Psychological factors affect the speed of recovery; confidence measurably "
"improves rehab outcomes."

#: .\injury\services.py:222
msgid "Vascularisation 促進循環"
msgstr "Vascularisation"

#: .\injury\services.py:222
msgid "做不痛的低衝擊有氧（定速腳踏車、水中跑），增加患部血流。"
msgstr ""
"Do pain-free low-impact aerobic work (steady cycling, water running) to "
"raise blood flow to the area."

#: .\injury\services.py:223
msgid "Exercise 運動復健"
msgstr "Exercise"

#: .\injury\services.py:223
msgid "在指導下逐步恢復關節活動度、肌力、核心穩定與本體覺。"
msgstr ""
"Under guidance, rebuild range of motion, strength, core stability and "
"proprioception step by step."

#: .\injury\services.py:234
msgid "急性期現場處置 PEACE"
msgstr "PEACE — On-site care in the acute phase"

#: .\injury\services.py:234
msgid "復健期 LOVE"
msgstr "LOVE — The rehab phase"

#: .\injury\services.py:236
msgid "受傷 1-3 天：目標是限制組織進一步受損、控制發炎、緩解疼痛。"
msgstr ""
"Days 1–3 after injury: the goal is to limit further tissue damage, control "
"inflammation and ease pain."

#: .\injury\services.py:238
msgid "急性疼痛與紅腫減退後：目標轉為組織修復與功能重建。"
msgstr ""
"Once the acute pain and redness settle: the goal shifts to tissue repair and "
"rebuilding function."

#: .\injury\services.py:242
msgid ""
"無法負重、關節變形、劇烈刺痛或腫脹持續不退 → 24-72 小時內看復健科 / 骨科 / 運"
"動醫學科，必要時 X 光排除骨折、超聲波或 MRI 評估韌帶與肌肉。"
msgstr ""
"Unable to bear weight, a deformed joint, sharp pain, or swelling that will "
"not settle → see a rehabilitation, orthopaedic or sports medicine doctor "
"within 24–72 hours, with an X-ray to rule out a fracture and ultrasound or "
"MRI to assess ligaments and muscle if needed."

#: .\injury\services.py:265
msgid "先記一次今日回報，系統才判斷得出加量或減量。"
msgstr ""
"Log today's report once first — the system cannot judge whether to add or "
"cut load until then."

#: .\injury\services.py:278 .\injury\services.py:282
msgid "運動當下疼痛 ≤ 3"
msgstr "Pain during activity ≤ 3"

#: .\injury\services.py:278 .\templates\web\nutrition.html:543
msgid "未記錄"
msgstr "Not recorded"

#: .\injury\services.py:284
#, python-format
msgid "記錄 %(v0)s/10"
msgstr "Recorded %(v0)s/10"

#: .\injury\services.py:285
msgid "，超過門檻應當場降強度或停下"
msgstr ", over the threshold — drop the intensity or stop on the spot"

#: .\injury\services.py:290 .\injury\services.py:294
msgid "運動後疼痛不加劇"
msgstr "Pain does not get worse after activity"

#: .\injury\services.py:290
msgid "需要同時填運動前與運動後"
msgstr "Both before and after activity have to be filled in"

#: .\injury\services.py:296
#, python-format
msgid "運動前 %(v0)s → 運動後 %(v1)s"
msgstr "Before %(v0)s → after %(v1)s"

#: .\injury\services.py:301 .\injury\services.py:305
msgid "隔天早上完全恢復"
msgstr "Fully recovered by the next morning"

#: .\injury\services.py:301
msgid "等明天的回報才判斷得出"
msgstr "Tomorrow's report is needed before this can be judged"

#: .\injury\services.py:307
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s 前 %(v1)s → %(v2)s 早上 %(v3)s"
msgstr "%(v0)s before %(v1)s → %(v2)s morning %(v3)s"

#: .\injury\services.py:315
msgid "減量"
msgstr "Cut back"

#: .\injury\services.py:317
msgid ""
"有標準沒過，代表現在的強度或總量超過負荷。下一次先降一項——強度（幾分力、幾公"
"斤、幾分速）與總量（球數、距離、組數）不要同時降兩項，才知道是哪一項太多。"
msgstr ""
"A criterion was not met, which means the current intensity or volume is more "
"than the body can take. Next time drop one of them first — do not cut "
"intensity (effort, kilos, pace) and volume (throws, distance, sets) at the "
"same time, or there is no telling which one was too much."

#: .\injury\services.py:320 .\templates\web\analytics.html:243
msgid "資料不足"
msgstr "Not enough data"

#: .\injury\services.py:321
msgid ""
"把運動前 / 運動中 / 運動後三個數字都填上，明天再填一次早上的數字，系統就判斷"
"得出。"
msgstr ""
"Fill in all three numbers — before, during and after activity — then fill in "
"the morning number again tomorrow, and the system can judge it."

#: .\injury\services.py:323
msgid "可小幅加量"
msgstr "Small increase is fine"

#: .\injury\services.py:325
msgid ""
"三個標準都過了，身體能適應這個強度與總量。下一次只加一項，幅度約 10%，加完再"
"用同樣三個標準檢查一次。"
msgstr ""
"All three criteria were met, so the body is coping with this intensity and "
"volume. Next time add one of them only, by about 10%, then check against the "
"same three criteria again."

#: .\injury\services.py:384
msgid "先確定是什麼傷、能不能練"
msgstr "First find out what the injury is and whether training is possible"

#: .\injury\services.py:386
msgid "48 小時內找醫生或物理治療師做一次評估"
msgstr "Get an assessment from a doctor or physiotherapist within 48 hours"

#: .\injury\services.py:387
msgid "必要時安排影像檢查（X 光 / 超聲波 / MRI）"
msgstr "Arrange imaging if needed (X-ray / ultrasound / MRI)"

#: .\injury\services.py:388
msgid "先停掉所有會誘發疼痛的動作，改做不痛的替代動作"
msgstr ""
"Stop every movement that provokes pain and switch to pain-free substitutes"

#: .\injury\services.py:391
msgid "拿到診斷、知道禁忌動作之後 → 進入消炎止痛"
msgstr ""
"Once there is a diagnosis and the contraindicated movements are known → move "
"on to anti-inflammatory and pain relief"

#: .\injury\services.py:394
msgid "把靜態疼痛與腫脹壓下來"
msgstr "Bring the resting pain and the swelling down"

#: .\injury\services.py:396
msgid "急性期 72 小時：相對休息、冰敷、加壓、抬高"
msgstr "First 72 hours: relative rest, ice, compression, elevation"

#: .\injury\services.py:397
msgid "維持不痛範圍內的關節活動，避免完全不動"
msgstr ""
"Keep the joint moving within the pain-free range rather than not moving at "
"all"

#: .\injury\services.py:398
msgid "用替代動作維持其他部位的體能與有氧"
msgstr ""
"Use substitute exercises to maintain fitness and aerobic base elsewhere"

#: .\injury\services.py:401
msgid "靜態疼痛 ≤ 2、腫脹消退 → 進入恢復功能"
msgstr "Pain at rest ≤ 2 and swelling settled → move on to restoring function"

#: .\injury\services.py:404
msgid "把活動度與基本肌力拿回來"
msgstr "Get range of motion and basic strength back"

#: .\injury\services.py:406
msgid "每日等長 → 向心 → 離心的漸進負荷"
msgstr "Daily progressive loading: isometric → concentric → eccentric"

#: .\injury\services.py:407
msgid "處理代償：對側與鄰近關節一併訓練"
msgstr ""
"Deal with compensation: train the other side and the neighbouring joints as "
"well"

#: .\injury\services.py:408
msgid "手法治療或針灸處理殘留的緊繃點"
msgstr "Use manual therapy or acupuncture on the tight spots that remain"

#: .\injury\services.py:411
msgid "活動度對稱、患側肌力達健側 80% → 進入重建體能"
msgstr ""
"Symmetrical range of motion, injured side at 80% of the healthy side → move "
"on to rebuilding fitness"

#: .\injury\services.py:414
msgid "把專項強度加回去，準備回歸"
msgstr "Add the event-specific intensity back in, ready to return"

#: .\injury\services.py:416
msgid "跑動由慢到快分級：慢跑 → 節奏跑 → 加速 → 全速"
msgstr ""
"Grade the running from slow to fast: jog → tempo → acceleration → full speed"

#: .\injury\services.py:417
msgid "加入離心負荷與增強式，重建肌腱耐受度"
msgstr ""
"Add eccentric loading and plyometrics to rebuild the tendon's tolerance"

#: .\injury\services.py:418
msgid "每次加量後 24 小時內疼痛不得回升超過 2 分"
msgstr ""
"After each increase, pain must not rise by more than 2 points within 24 hours"

#: .\injury\services.py:421
msgid "通過 RTP 檢核表全部條件 → 結案回歸完整訓練"
msgstr ""
"Every item on the RTP checklist passed → close the case and return to full "
"training"

#: .\injury\services.py:427
msgid "肌肉拉傷最常在「還會痛就衝刺」時復發，離心負荷要練足。"
msgstr ""
"Muscle strains most often recur when an athlete sprints while it still "
"hurts; do the eccentric loading properly."

#: .\injury\services.py:428
msgid "扭傷後本體感覺會下降，單腳平衡與變向訓練不能省。"
msgstr ""
"Proprioception drops after a sprain, so single-leg balance and change-of-"
"direction work cannot be skipped."

#: .\injury\services.py:429
msgid "肌腱病變怕的是完全休息，要用可忍受的疼痛（≤3/10）持續加載。"
msgstr ""
"What tendinopathy does not tolerate is complete rest; keep loading it at a "
"tolerable pain level (≤3/10)."

#: .\injury\services.py:430
msgid "骨膜炎先減衝擊量與換場地／鞋，止痛只是治標。"
msgstr ""
"For periostitis, cut the impact volume and change the surface or the shoes "
"first — painkillers only treat the symptom."

#: .\injury\services.py:431
msgid "應力性骨折必須由醫生決定何時負重，不可自行加量。"
msgstr ""
"With a stress fracture, a doctor decides when to bear weight; never add load "
"on your own."

#: .\injury\services.py:432
msgid "挫傷早期避免熱敷與強力按摩，慎防骨化性肌炎。"
msgstr ""
"Avoid heat and hard massage early on with a contusion, and watch for "
"myositis ossificans."

#: .\injury\services.py:433
msgid "過度使用是訓練量的問題，回歸前要一併修正課表安排。"
msgstr ""
"Overuse is a training volume problem; fix the programme itself before "
"returning."

#: .\injury\views.py:115
msgid "請提供 body_part 參數。"
msgstr "Please supply the body_part parameter."

