msgstr "45–60 minutes before training"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:162
msgid "提升警覺與衝刺表現"
msgstr "Better alertness and sprint performance"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:163
msgid "訓練後 / 蛋白攝取不足時"
msgstr "After training / when protein intake falls short"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:163
msgid "補足每日蛋白需求"
msgstr "Tops up the daily protein requirement"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:164
msgid "隨餐"
msgstr "With a meal"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:164
msgid "骨骼健康、肌肉功能"
msgstr "Bone health, muscle function"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:165
msgid "依血檢調整"
msgstr "Adjust to blood test results"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:165
msgid "空腹配維他命C"
msgstr "On an empty stomach with vitamin C"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:165
msgid "耐力運動員常見缺乏（須先驗血）"
msgstr "Commonly low in endurance athletes (get a blood test first)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:166
msgid "分次服用"
msgstr "Split into several doses"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:166
msgid "緩衝乳酸，對 400m–1500m 有效"
msgstr "Buffers lactate; effective for 400 m–1500 m"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:167
msgid "賽前 90–150 分鐘"
msgstr "90–150 minutes before competition"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:167
msgid "血液緩衝（腸胃反應需先測試）"
msgstr "Blood buffering (test for stomach upset first)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:227 .\templates\web\analytics.html:1060
msgid "體脂率"
msgstr "Body Fat %"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:240 .\templates\web\analytics.html:842
#: .\templates\web\dashboard.html:203
msgid "去脂體重"
msgstr "Lean Body Mass"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:248
msgid "脂肪量"
msgstr "Fat Mass"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:257 .\templates\web\dashboard.html:206
msgid "體水分率"
msgstr "Body Water %"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:263
msgid "Mifflin-St Jeor（依體重身高）"
msgstr "Mifflin-St Jeor (from weight and height)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:265
#, python-format
msgid "體組成磅量測（%(v0)s）"
msgstr "Body composition scale reading (%(v0)s)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:267
msgid "Katch-McArdle（依去脂體重）"
msgstr "Katch-McArdle (from lean body mass)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:272
#, python-format
msgid ""
"依去脂體重算出的 BMR 是 %(katch)s kcal，比只看體重身高的 %(mifflin)s kcal 高 "
"%(diff)s kcal——肌肉量偏離同體重的平均值，熱量目標可以往這個方向微調。"
msgstr ""
"BMR from lean body mass is %(katch)s kcal, %(diff)s kcal higher than the "
"%(mifflin)s kcal from weight and height alone — muscle mass sits away from "
"the average for this body weight, so the calorie target can be nudged in "
"that direction."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:277
#, python-format
msgid ""
"依去脂體重算出的 BMR 是 %(katch)s kcal，比只看體重身高的 %(mifflin)s kcal 低 "
"%(diff)s kcal——肌肉量偏離同體重的平均值，熱量目標可以往這個方向微調。"
msgstr ""
"BMR from lean body mass is %(katch)s kcal, %(diff)s kcal lower than the "
"%(mifflin)s kcal from weight and height alone — muscle mass sits away from "
"the average for this body weight, so the calorie target can be nudged in "
"that direction."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:293
#, python-format
msgid ""
"今日蛋白目標換算成去脂體重是 %(v0)s g/kg LBM，增肌期建議 2.0-2.4 g/kg LBM，可"
"以再加一點。"
msgstr ""
"Today's protein target works out to %(v0)s g/kg LBM. For a muscle-building "
"phase 2.0-2.4 g/kg LBM is suggested, so there is room to add a little."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:303
#, python-format
msgid ""
"體脂 %(pct).1f%% 高於此性別的競賽參考帶（%(low).0f-%(high).0f%%），減脂請走每"
"週 0.5%% 體重的緩降，別在高強度期做大幅赤字。"
msgstr ""
"Body fat of %(pct).1f%% is above the competitive reference band for this sex "
"(%(low).0f-%(high).0f%%). Come down slowly, about 0.5%% of body weight a "
"week, and do not run a large deficit during a high-intensity phase."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:310
#, python-format
msgid ""
"體脂 %(pct).1f%% 低於參考帶下緣（%(low).0f%%），留意能量供應不足（RED-S）：月"
"經、睡眠、晨脈與骨骼健康都要一起看。"
msgstr ""
"Body fat of %(pct).1f%% is below the bottom of the reference band "
"(%(low).0f%%). Watch for low energy availability (RED-S): menstrual health, "
"sleep, morning heart rate and bone health all have to be read together."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:318
msgid "下肢肌肉量"
msgstr "Lower-body muscle mass"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:319
msgid "上肢肌肉量"
msgstr "Upper-body muscle mass"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:327
#, python-format
msgid "%(label)s左右差 %(diff).2f kg（%(pct).0f%%）"
msgstr "%(label)s differs by %(diff).2f kg between sides (%(pct).0f%%)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:331
msgid "——差距超過 5%，配合單邊力量訓練與傷患紀錄一起看。"
msgstr ""
" — a gap of over 5%; read it alongside single-side strength work and the "
"injury records."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:352
msgid "香蕉 1 條 + 蜂蜜水 300ml"
msgstr "1 banana + 300 ml honey water"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:352
msgid "訓練後 30 分鐘內最快補回肝醣"
msgstr "The fastest way to put glycogen back within 30 minutes of training"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:353
msgid "白飯 1 碗（200g）"
msgstr "1 bowl of rice (200 g)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:353
msgid "最便宜的碳水，配主餐一起加量"
msgstr "The cheapest carbohydrate; add more of it to a main meal"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:354
msgid "烏冬 / 意粉 1 份（乾重 80g）"
msgstr "1 serving of udon / pasta (80 g dry)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:354
msgid "訓練前 3 小時的主食"
msgstr "The staple for 3 hours before training"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:355
msgid "低脂朱古力奶 500ml"
msgstr "500 ml low-fat chocolate milk"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:355
msgid "碳水蛋白比約 3:1，經典的訓練後恢復飲"
msgstr "About 3:1 carbs to protein — the classic post-training recovery drink"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:356
msgid "運動飲料 500ml"
msgstr "500 ml sports drink"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:356
msgid "長時間或高溫訓練時補水與電解質"
msgstr "Fluid and electrolytes for long or hot sessions"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:357
msgid "雞胸肉 150g"
msgstr "150 g chicken breast"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:357
msgid "低脂高蛋白，午晚餐加一份"
msgstr "Low fat, high protein; add a serving to lunch or dinner"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:358
msgid "乳清蛋白 1 匙 + 水"
msgstr "1 scoop whey protein + water"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:358
msgid "蛋白差得不多時用來補尾數"
msgstr "For topping up the last few grams when protein is only just short"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:359
msgid "希臘乳酪 200g"
msgstr "200 g Greek yoghurt"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:359
msgid "睡前的慢消化蛋白"
msgstr "Slow-digesting protein before bed"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:360
msgid "雞蛋 2 隻"
msgstr "2 eggs"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:360
msgid "早餐或加餐，同時補脂肪"
msgstr "Breakfast or a snack, with some fat alongside"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:361
msgid "原味堅果 30g"
msgstr "30 g plain nuts"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:361
msgid "熱量密度高，補脂肪不佔胃"
msgstr "Calorie-dense; adds fat without filling the stomach"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:362
msgid "牛油果半個"
msgstr "Half an avocado"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:362
msgid "單元不飽和脂肪，配沙拉或多士"
msgstr "Monounsaturated fat; have it with salad or on toast"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:437
#, python-format
msgid "（今日訓練排在%(v0)s）"
msgstr " (today's session: %(v0)s)"

#: .\nutrition\services.py:439
#, python-format
msgid "訓練前 2-3 小時%(v0)s：以碳水為主、低脂低纖的一餐，避免腸胃不適。"
msgstr ""
"2-3 hours before training%(v0)s: a mostly carbohydrate meal, low in fat and "
"fibre, to avoid stomach trouble."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:440
msgid "訓練前 30-60 分鐘：一份好消化的碳水（香蕉、能量棒），不要試新東西。"
msgstr ""
"30-60 minutes before training: one easily digested carbohydrate (a banana, "
"an energy bar) — nothing new on the day."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:441
msgid "訓練中超過 60 分鐘：每小時 30-60 g 碳水 ＋ 含電解質的水。"
msgstr ""
"Sessions over 60 minutes: 30-60 g of carbohydrate per hour plus water with "
"electrolytes."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:442
msgid "訓練後 30-60 分鐘：碳水 1.0-1.2 g/kg ＋ 蛋白 0.3-0.4 g/kg，越早越好。"
msgstr ""
"30-60 minutes after training: 1.0-1.2 g/kg carbohydrate plus 0.3-0.4 g/kg "
"protein, the sooner the better."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:443
msgid "睡前：20-40 g 慢消化蛋白（希臘乳酪、酪蛋白），支撐夜間修復。"
msgstr ""
"Before bed: 20-40 g of slow-digesting protein (Greek yoghurt, casein) to "
"support overnight repair."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:447
msgid "今天沒有排訓練：熱量與碳水本來就該比訓練日低，別硬補到訓練日的量。"
msgstr ""
"No training today: calories and carbohydrate should be lower than on a "
"training day anyway, so do not force them up to training-day levels."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:448
msgid "蛋白質不減：休息日才是肌肉真正修復的時候，維持每餐 0.3-0.4 g/kg。"
msgstr ""
"Protein stays the same: rest days are when muscle actually repairs, so keep "
"0.3-0.4 g/kg at each meal."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:474
msgid ""
"赤字只從脂肪與精緻碳水扣，訓練前後的碳水一律不動——那是拿來跑的，不是拿來胖"
"的。"
msgstr ""
"Take the deficit out of fat and refined carbs only. The carbs around "
"training stay untouched: those are there to be run on."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:475
msgid ""
"休息日把碳水降下來、訓練日照吃：一週的赤字靠休息日湊，高強度日不要餓著練。"
msgstr ""
"Lower carbs on rest days and eat normally on training days: build the week's "
"deficit out of rest days, and never train hard hungry."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:476
msgid ""
"每餐 0.4 g/kg 蛋白、分 4 餐，睡前再加一份慢消化蛋白，減脂期守肌肉靠這個。"
msgstr ""
"0.4 g/kg of protein per meal over 4 meals, plus a slow-digesting protein "
"before bed. That is what holds muscle through a cut."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:477
msgid "重訓的重量不要降。減脂期減的是量不是強度，強度一降，掉的就會是肌肉。"
msgstr ""
"Do not drop the weights. A cut cuts volume, not intensity; the moment "
"intensity drops, muscle is what goes."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:478
msgid ""
"每週固定同一天、同一時間、同一狀態量體重與體脂，只看週平均，不看單日跳動。"
msgstr ""
"Weigh in and measure body fat on the same day, at the same time, in the same "
"state each week, and read the weekly average rather than a single day's "
"swing."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:481
msgid "小赤字就好：一天少一份精緻碳水或一份油，不用改整個菜單。"
msgstr ""
"A small deficit is enough: one fewer serving of refined carbs or one fewer "
"serving of fat a day, no need to rewrite the menu."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:482
msgid "賽前期或高強度週先暫停赤字，回到維持量，比賽完再修。"
msgstr ""
"Pause the deficit in a pre-competition or high-intensity week, go back to "
"maintenance, and resume after the meet."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:483
msgid "蛋白與訓練前後的碳水維持原樣，只動訓練以外的時段。"
msgstr ""
"Keep protein and the carbs around training as they are; only adjust the "
"hours away from training."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:486
msgid "盈餘放在訓練後：練完 30–60 分鐘那一餐加碳水加蛋白，增的才會進肌肉。"
msgstr ""
"Put the surplus after training: add carbs and protein to the meal 30-60 "
"minutes post-session so the gain goes into muscle."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:487
msgid "每天多一餐加餐（果仁、乳酪、朱古力奶），不要靠正餐硬塞到脹。"
msgstr ""
"Add one extra snack a day (nuts, yoghurt, chocolate milk) instead of forcing "
"bigger main meals."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:488
msgid "重訓要有漸進超負荷：熱量加了但重量沒加，加的就是脂肪。"
msgstr ""
"Strength work has to progress: if calories go up but the bar does not, what "
"gets added is fat."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:489
msgid "每兩週檢查一次體脂率：體重升、體脂率也升得快，就把盈餘收一半。"
msgstr ""
"Check body fat every two weeks: if weight rises and body fat rises just as "
"fast, cut the surplus in half."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:492
msgid ""
"先把熱量吃回維持量以上，這不是增肌是止血——能量供應不足會拖垮荷爾蒙、骨質與睡"
"眠。"
msgstr ""
"Get calories back above maintenance first. This is not bulking, it is "
"stopping the bleeding: low energy availability drags down hormones, bone and "
"sleep."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:493
msgid "碳水優先補回來：肝醣是速度與力量的燃料，低碳水撐不起高強度訓練。"
msgstr ""
"Carbs come back first: glycogen is the fuel for speed and strength, and low "
"carbs cannot hold up high-intensity training."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:494
msgid "這一段先不要量體脂追數字，看的是晨脈、睡眠、月經（女生）與訓練感覺。"
msgstr ""
"Stop chasing body-fat numbers for this stretch; watch resting heart rate, "
"sleep, the menstrual cycle (for female athletes) and how training feels."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:495
msgid "同時把這件事告訴教練與隊醫，RED-S 不是靠自己調飲食就能解決的。"
msgstr ""
"Tell the coach and the team doctor as well: RED-S is not something to fix by "
"adjusting your own diet."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:541
#, python-format
msgid ""
"走完這 %(weeks)s 週，%(name)s 每公斤體重舉得起的會從 %(now)s 變成 %(then)s（+"
"%(gain).1f%%）——起跑與跳躍靠的就是這個比值。"
msgstr ""
"After these %(weeks)s weeks, what %(name)s lifts per kilogram of body weight "
"goes from %(now)s to %(then)s (+%(gain).1f%%), and starts and jumps run on "
"exactly this ratio."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:553
#, python-format
msgid ""
"減下來的 %(kg)s kg 是純負重：力量一分沒少，每一步、每一跳要抬的重量卻少了這麼"
"多。"
msgstr ""
"The %(kg)s kg that comes off is pure dead weight: not one bit of strength "
"lost, and every step and every jump has that much less to lift."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:558
msgid ""
"加的是去脂體重，絕對力量跟著上去；只要體脂率守住，相對力量就不會被體重吃掉。"
msgstr ""
"What gets added is lean mass, so absolute strength follows. Keep body fat in "
"check and body weight will not eat the relative strength."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:611
msgid "建立節奏：同一天同一時間量體重與體脂，這一段先求穩定不求快。"
msgstr ""
"Build the rhythm: weigh in and measure body fat on the same day at the same "
"time; this block is about being consistent, not fast."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:613
msgid "收尾：回到維持量，讓體重在目標上下 0.5 kg 站穩兩週再談下一步。"
msgstr ""
"Finish: back to maintenance, and hold within 0.5 kg of the target for two "
"weeks before talking about the next step."

#: .\nutrition\services.py:615
msgid "檢查點：連續兩週沒動就把熱量再調 10%，有動就一個字都不要改。"
msgstr ""
"Checkpoint: if nothing has moved for two weeks straight, adjust calories by "
"another 10%; if it is moving, change nothing at all."

#: .\nutrition\vision.py:185
msgid "沒有比對到食物"
msgstr "No food matched"

#: .\nutrition\vision.py:186
msgid "以食物字典的常見份量估算，克數請自己改成實際的份量。"
msgstr ""
"Estimated from the food dictionary's typical serving; change the grams to "
"what was actually eaten."

#: .\nutrition\vision.py:188
#, python-format
msgid "字典裡沒有 %(v0)s（可以在後台的食物字典加進去）。"
msgstr ""
"Not in the dictionary: %(v0)s (you can add it to the food dictionary in the "
"admin)."

#: .\nutrition\vision.py:204
msgid "相片格式不支援（要 jpg / png / webp / gif），改用文字估算。"
msgstr ""
"That photo format is not supported (jpg / png / webp / gif only), so the "
"estimate comes from the text."

#: .\nutrition\vision.py:206
msgid "相片超過 5 MB，改用文字估算；請用手機拍照的壓縮檔。"
msgstr ""
"The photo is over 5 MB, so the estimate comes from the text. Use the "
"compressed file the phone camera produces."

#: .\nutrition\vision.py:222
#, python-format
msgid "相片辨識沒成功（%(v0)s），改用文字估算。"
msgstr ""
"Reading the photo did not work (%(v0)s), so the estimate comes from the text."

#: .\nutrition\vision.py:228
msgid ""
"這台伺服器沒有設定 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY，暫時看不了相片；相片會存起來，營養先用"
"文字估算。"
msgstr ""
"This server has no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY set, so photos cannot be read for now. "
"The photo is kept, and the nutrition is estimated from the text."

