msgid ""
"ATM 為每一位運動員量身建立訓練紀錄與分析：課後強度、負荷趨勢、恢復與傷勢，全"
"部留在同一份檔案裡。附短跑訓練專業用詞中英對照表。"
msgstr ""
"ATM builds a training record and analysis for each athlete individually: "
"session intensity, load trends, recovery and injuries all stay in the one "
"file. It comes with a Chinese–English glossary of sprint training terms."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:29
msgid "一百公尺的四段"
msgstr "The Four Parts of 100 Metres"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:30 .\templates\site\landing.html:182
#: .\templates\site\landing.html:313
msgid "專業用詞"
msgstr "Professional Terms"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:31
msgid "紀錄與分析"
msgstr "Records and Analysis"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:53
msgid "課表不是罐頭，"
msgstr "Sessions are not off the shelf,"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:53
msgid "紀錄與分析要為人而做"
msgstr "and records and analysis are made for a person"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:55
msgid ""
"ATM 不派發現成的訓練課表。它把每一堂課的內容、強度、恢復狀況與傷勢完整記下"
"來， 再換算成教練看得懂的趨勢——課表是教練在持續訓練中逐步認識這名運動員之後長"
"出來的， 系統負責讓這個過程一直有依據可循。"
msgstr ""
"ATM does not hand out ready-made training sessions. It records in full what "
"was done in each session, at what intensity, how recovery went and what "
"hurt, then turns that into trends a coach can read — the programme grows out "
"of a coach getting to know that athlete over continued training, and the "
"system keeps that process grounded in something."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:59 .\templates\site\landing.html:299
msgid "進入我的儀表板"
msgstr "Go to my dashboard"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:61
msgid "登入 ATM 系統"
msgstr "Log in to ATM"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:63
msgid "看系統怎麼運作"
msgstr "See how the system works"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:71
msgid ""
"緩慢旋轉的標準四百公尺田徑場：紅色膠面、八條白色分道、綠色內場，標有各項目起"
"跑線、每一百公尺的過程標記與終點線"
msgstr ""
"A standard 400-metre track turning slowly: red surface, eight white lanes, "
"green infield, marked with the start lines for each event, the 100-metre "
"progress markers and the finish line"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:79
msgid "挑戰完成"
msgstr "Challenge complete"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:82 .\templates\web\video_detail.html:148
msgid "平均速度"
msgstr "Average speed"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:83
msgid "最高速度"
msgstr "Top speed"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:84
msgid "前 50 / 後 50"
msgstr "First 50 / last 50"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:85
msgid "連打頻率"
msgstr "Tap rate"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:85
msgid "下/秒"
msgstr "taps/sec"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:87
msgid "每十公尺分段"
msgstr "Every ten metres"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:89
msgid "再來"
msgstr "Again"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:93
msgid "開啟 JavaScript 可看到跑道動畫與一百公尺挑戰。"
msgstr ""
"Turn JavaScript on to see the track animation and the 100-metre challenge."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:99
msgid "0 / 80 下"
msgstr "0 / 80 taps"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:104 .\templates\web\video_detail.html:141
msgid "時間"
msgstr "Time"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:106 .\templates\web\video_detail.html:90
msgid "速度"
msgstr "Speed"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:107
msgid "階段"
msgstr "Phase"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:107
msgid "待命"
msgstr "Ready"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:110
msgid "接受挑戰"
msgstr "Take the challenge"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:111
msgid "看示範"
msgstr "Watch the demo"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:117
msgid ""
"挑戰：聽 On your marks → Set → 鳴槍 GO，之後連打滑鼠左鍵，每下前進 1.25 公"
"尺， 按滿 80 下衝過終點；GO 之前先按就算搶跑（會補鳴召回槍）。示範則依 v(t) "
"＝ v"
msgstr ""
"The challenge: listen for On your marks → Set → the gun, then tap the left "
"mouse button repeatedly. Each tap moves you 1.25 metres, and 80 taps take "
"you through the finish; tapping before GO is a false start (a recall gun "
"follows). The demo runs on v(t) = v"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:117
msgid "）演算，僅作階段示意。"
msgstr "), and is only a rough illustration of the phases."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:120
msgid ""
"場地按規格繪製：直道 84.39 m、內側緣石半徑 36.50 m、分道寬 1.22 m、共八道， "
"第一道一圈剛好 400 m。"
msgstr ""
"The track is drawn to specification: 84.39 m straights, a 36.50 m inside "
"kerb radius, 1.22 m lanes and eight of them, so lane one is exactly 400 m "
"round."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:120
msgid "與"
msgstr " and "

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:120
msgid "在直道延伸段上共用一條起跑線；"
msgstr " share one start line on the extension of the straight; "

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:121
msgid "的分道差是沿各道自身路線由終點回量算出來的，"
msgstr ""
" has its lane stagger measured back from the finish along the path of each "
"lane, "

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:122
msgid "用一圈彎道的分道差；白色粗線為終點，另有 100 / 200 / 300 m 的過程標記。"
msgstr ""
" uses the stagger of a single bend; the thick white line is the finish, with "
"100 / 200 / 300 m progress markers as well."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:128
msgid "適用項目"
msgstr "Events it covers"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:129
msgid "100 m · 200 m · 400 m · 4×100 m 接力 · 110/100 m 跨欄"
msgstr "100 m · 200 m · 400 m · 4×100 m relay · 110/100 m hurdles"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:140
msgid "一趟一百公尺，"
msgstr "One hundred metres"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:140
msgid "其實是四種能力"
msgstr "is really four abilities"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:143
msgid ""
"起跑、加速、最高速與維持速度，用的是不同的力學與能量系統。 分開看，才知道一名"
"運動員的差距落在哪一段——這也是 ATM 分析成績時的切分方式。"
msgstr ""
"The start, acceleration, top speed and holding speed run on different "
"mechanics and different energy systems. Only by reading them separately can "
"you see which part of the race an athlete loses — and that is how ATM breaks "
"a mark down."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:150
msgid "起跑與反應"
msgstr "Start and Reaction"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:151
msgid ""
"反應時間，加上前兩步的推蹬方向。離開起跑器時軀幹接近四十五度，急著站起來等於"
"把加速距離讓出去。"
msgstr ""
"Reaction time, plus the direction of the drive in the first two steps. The "
"trunk leaves the blocks at around forty-five degrees; standing up in a hurry "
"gives away the acceleration distance."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:156
msgid "加速期"
msgstr "Acceleration"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:157
msgid "身體由前傾逐步轉為直立，步頻與步幅同時增長。這一段最吃水平推進力。"
msgstr ""
"The body moves from leaning to upright, with step frequency and stride "
"length both growing. This part lives on horizontal drive."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:163
msgid "速度的天花板。關鍵在觸地時間縮短與下肢剛性，不是更用力往下踩。"
msgstr ""
"The ceiling on speed. What matters is shorter ground contact and stiffness "
"in the legs, not stamping down harder."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:168
msgid "速度維持"
msgstr "Speed Maintenance"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:169
msgid "沒有人能一路加速到終點，名次常在這裡拉開。目標是減速得比對手慢。"
msgstr ""
"Nobody accelerates all the way to the line, and this is usually where places "
"are decided. The aim is to slow down less than the opposition."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:182
msgid "短跑訓練的"
msgstr "The "

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:185
msgid ""
"同一件事，教練、運動員與家長常常各有各的說法。把詞固定下來——中英並列、 一句話"
"說清楚——課表上的字、系統裡的欄位與跑道邊的口令才會指向同一件事。 選一個分類，"
"或直接搜尋；一頁最多十條，其餘用分頁翻。"
msgstr ""
"Coaches, athletes and parents often each have their own way of saying the "
"same thing. Fixing the words down — Chinese and English side by side, one "
"sentence each — is what makes the words on a session plan, the fields in the "
"system and the calls at the trackside point at the same thing. Pick a "
"category, or just search; ten entries per page, the rest on the following "
"pages."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:192 .\templates\web\_session_body.html:576
#: .\templates\web\video.html:56
msgid "全部"
msgstr "All"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:202
msgid "搜尋術語"
msgstr "Search terms"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:204
msgid "搜尋中英文或解釋…"
msgstr "Search Chinese, English or the explanation…"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:226
msgid "沒有符合的詞條，換個關鍵字試試。"
msgstr "No entries match; try another keyword."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:227
msgid "術語表分頁"
msgstr "Glossary pages"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:237
msgid "把訓練變成"
msgstr "Turning training into"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:237
msgid "一份長期的檔案"
msgstr "a long-term record"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:240
msgid ""
"好的課表不是查表查出來的，是教練看著同一名運動員練了幾個月之後才寫得出來。 "
"ATM 要做的，是讓這幾個月不至於憑印象——每一堂課留下數字，每一次調整都有根據。"
msgstr ""
"A good session plan is not looked up in a table; a coach writes it after "
"watching the same athlete train for months. What ATM is for is to keep those "
"months from resting on impressions — every session leaves numbers, and every "
"adjustment has something behind it."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:247
msgid "逐課記錄"
msgstr "Session by session"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:248
msgid ""
"課後填一次自覺強度與實際時長，跑道上的分段與重量室的組次一併留存。花的時間不"
"到一分鐘，累積下來就是這名運動員的訓練史。"
msgstr ""
"After training, fill in perceived effort and actual duration once, and the "
"splits from the track and the sets from the weight room are kept with them. "
"It takes under a minute, and it adds up into this athlete's training history."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:252
msgid "每日狀態"
msgstr "Daily state"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:253
msgid ""
"睡眠、痠痛、壓力與疼痛分數，構成當日的準備度。今天適不適合照原本的安排練，不"
"必只靠一句「還可以」。"
msgstr ""
"Sleep, soreness, stress and pain scores make up the day's readiness. Whether "
"today suits the session as planned no longer rests on \"I'm alright\"."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:257
msgid "自動換算"
msgstr "Worked out automatically"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:258
msgid ""
"系統把紀錄轉成訓練負荷、急慢性負荷比、單調度與壓力值，並標出負荷驟增的那一"
"週。數字用來提問，不是用來下結論。"
msgstr ""
"The system turns the records into training load, acute:chronic ratio, "
"monotony and strain, and marks the week where load jumped. The numbers are "
"there to raise questions, not to settle them."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:262
msgid "教練調整"
msgstr "The coach adjusts"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:263
msgid ""
"教練看著趨勢與運動員本人的回饋，決定下一段怎麼練。課表因此是「這個人的」，而"
"不是從範本複製過來的。"
msgstr ""
"Reading the trends and the athlete's own feedback, the coach decides how the "
"next stretch is trained. That is what makes a session plan this person's, "
"rather than a copy of a template."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:269
msgid "量身，而不是套用"
msgstr "Made to measure, not applied"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:270
msgid ""
"系統提供的是模板與紀錄結構，不是標準答案。同樣一份模板，派到兩名運動員身上之"
"後會往不同方向長，因為每次調整都寫回各自的檔案。"
msgstr ""
"What the system supplies is templates and a structure for records, not "
"standard answers. The same template sent to two athletes grows in different "
"directions, because every adjustment is written back into their own file."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:273
msgid "教練與運動員看同一份資料"
msgstr "Coach and athlete read the same thing"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:274
msgid ""
"不需要來回問「上禮拜練了什麼」。團隊儀表板上誰負荷偏高、誰帶著傷還在練，一眼"
"可見，討論從同一個事實開始。"
msgstr ""
"No more asking back and forth what was done last week. Who is carrying too "
"much load and who is training with an injury are visible at a glance on the "
"team dashboard, so the discussion starts from the same facts."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:277
msgid "安全網先於課表"
msgstr "The safety net comes before the session plan"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:278
msgid ""
"活動時疼痛達門檻，當日的高強度課自動降級，並依受傷部位換成不加重傷勢的替代動"
"作。能站上跑道，比任何一堂課的內容都重要。"
msgstr ""
"When pain during activity reaches the threshold, that day's high-intensity "
"session is downgraded automatically and the movements are swapped for ones "
"that do not aggravate the injured area. Being able to get on the track "
"matters more than the content of any single session."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:289
msgid "報名訓練，或登入你的檔案"
msgstr "Enter a program, or log in to your profile"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:291
msgid ""
"公開招生的力量與體能課、專項訓練營都在「項目報名」裡，線上填一次表格即可。 系"
"統帳號則由教練或管理員開設，已有帳號的話直接登入。"
msgstr ""
"The strength and conditioning classes and event camps open to the public are "
"all under \"Program entry\" — one online form is all it takes. System "
"accounts are created by a coach or an administrator; if you already have "
"one, just log in."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:295
msgid "報名資料會直接成為你在 ATM 的運動員檔案。"
msgstr "What you enter becomes your athlete profile in ATM."

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:296
msgid "查看開放中的項目"
msgstr "See the programs currently open"

#: .\templates\site\landing.html:301
