"「只是體重變了」。"
msgstr ""
"No body-composition records yet. Upload a body-composition report on the "
"\"Body data\" page and this can tell \"got stronger\" apart from \"just "
"changed weight\"."

#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:820
#, python-format
msgid "%(v0)s：相對力量 vs 體脂與體重"
msgstr "%(v0)s: relative strength vs body fat and body weight"

