msgstr ""
"Each point is that day's heaviest set, paired with the nearest body-"
"composition measurement"

#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:833
msgid "如果體脂／肌肉改變，重訓的數字會變成怎樣"
msgstr "What the weight-room numbers become if fat or muscle changes"

#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:834
#, python-format
msgid "以 %(v0)s 推演"
msgstr "Modelled on %(v0)s"

#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:845
msgid "比值變化"
msgstr "Ratio change"

#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:882
msgid "點欄位標題可以照體重、體脂或比值排序，看得出哪一條路換到的比值最多。"
msgstr ""
"Click a column header to sort by weight, body fat or ratio, and see which "
"route buys the most."

#: .\templates\web\analytics.html:883
msgid ""
"減脂情境假設去脂體重守得住（蛋白吃夠、重訓強度不降），所以絕對力量不變、只有"
"負重變輕；增肌情境的絕對力量按去脂體重的 0.67 次方推估（肌肉出力約與橫切面積"
"成正比）。這是推估值，實際還是以下一次量測與真正舉起來的重量為準。"
msgstr ""
"The cut scenarios assume lean mass is held (enough protein, no drop in "
"training intensity), so absolute strength stays and only the load carried "
"gets lighter; the lean-gain scenarios scale absolute strength with lean mass "
"to the power of 0.67 (muscle force is roughly proportional to cross-"
"sectional area). These are estimates: the next measurement and the weight "
"actually lifted are what count."

