"百分比欄是該強度的訓練重量（已取整到 2.5 kg）：95%% ≈ 2 次、90%% ≈ 3 次、"
"85%% ≈ 5 次、80%% ≈ 6 次、75%% ≈ 8 次。把這幾個數字寫進課表，體組成的目標就變"
"成每一次上槓的重量。"
msgstr ""
"The percentage columns are the training loads at that intensity (rounded to "
"2.5 kg): 95%% is about 2 reps, 90%% about 3, 85%% about 5, 80%% about 6, "
"75%% about 8. Write these into the programme and the body-composition target "
"turns into the weight on the bar."

